---
---

<section class="sanctuary">
	<div class="container container--narrow">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<span class="eyebrow">Sanctuary Etiquette</span>
			<h2>The Art of Relaxing</h2>
		</div>

		<p class="sanctuary__intro">
			To honor the sanctity of your time with us, we suggest complete
			presence. Unless specified otherwise, undress comfortably and wear the
			provided spa garments. Our therapists are masters of discreet draping,
			ensuring your dignity and comfort are preserved at every stage of your
			treatment.
		</p>

		<div class="quote-card">
			<div class="quote-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10084;</div>
			<blockquote>
				"Close your eyes and allow your mind and body to be quiet. Breathe
				deeply and let tension slip away with each breath."
			</blockquote>
			<span class="quote-card__footer">This time is sacred. This time is yours.</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.sanctuary {
		padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.sanctuary__intro {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: var(--space-md) auto var(--space-xl);
		font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
	}

	.quote-card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
		transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-soft), box-shadow 0.4s ease;
	}

	.quote-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-6px);
		box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
	}

	.quote-card__icon {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
	}

	.quote-card blockquote {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
		line-height: 1.4;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin: 0 auto var(--space-md);
		max-width: 640px;
	}

	.quote-card__footer {
		display: block;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		letter-spacing: 0.24em;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
</style>
